# Copy this file to .env and paste your key in.
#
#   macOS / Linux:  cp .env.example .env
#   Windows:        copy .env.example .env
#
# SAME KEY YOU SET UP IN UNIT 1. Nothing new to sign up for.
#
# .env is listed in .gitignore, so it never reaches GitHub. Never paste your
# key into your code, your README, a screenshot, or a message. If you think
# you've exposed it, say so in the help channel and delete the key — keys are
# free to replace and nobody is in trouble for it.
#
# If you need a new one: https://aistudio.google.com — sign in with a Google
# account, CREATE YOUR OWN PROJECT when prompted, and make a key inside it.

GEMINI_API_KEY=your_key_here
# ─── Optional ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Turn the response cache off entirely (run_eval.py already does this).
# AI201_CACHE=0
